1
00:00:07,745 --> 00:00:09,065
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:37,265 --> 00:01:39,785
‎ADAPTED FROM XI XING’S NOVEL
<i>‎QUEEN CHU</i>‎ ON QIDIAN.COM

3
00:01:46,145 --> 00:01:47,065
‎TAIJI HALL

4
00:01:47,145 --> 00:01:49,625
Zhu Yong is backed by the Grand Princess.

5
00:01:49,705 --> 00:01:52,185
Now, in the Imperial Guard Office,
he's a favorite.

6
00:01:52,265 --> 00:01:54,785
The Imperial Guard Office
arrests anyone at will.

7
00:01:54,865 --> 00:01:56,185
Even Mr. Deng…

8
00:02:01,585 --> 00:02:03,785
His Majesty is here.

9
00:02:07,185 --> 00:02:09,144
‎DILIGENT AND VIRTUOUS

10
00:02:21,065 --> 00:02:22,345
Kneel.

11
00:02:26,585 --> 00:02:28,625
-Greetings, Your Majesty.
-Greetings, Your Majesty.

12
00:02:28,705 --> 00:02:30,785
-Greetings, Your Highness.
-Greetings, Your Highness.

13
00:02:31,385 --> 00:02:32,665
Bow.

14
00:02:36,065 --> 00:02:37,505
You may rise.

15
00:02:37,585 --> 00:02:39,905
-Thank you, Your Majesty.
-Thank you, Your Majesty.

16
00:02:43,745 --> 00:02:46,705
Your Highness, I request to go to Huzhou

17
00:02:46,785 --> 00:02:48,505
for the summer flood corruption case.

18
00:02:49,865 --> 00:02:52,305
-What?
-He wants to investigate?

19
00:02:52,905 --> 00:02:54,865
This is a serious case.

20
00:02:54,945 --> 00:02:57,305
The Commandant of Justice,
the Minister of Revenue,

21
00:02:57,385 --> 00:02:59,385
and the Imperial Guard Office
will co-investigate.

22
00:03:00,145 --> 00:03:01,505
Mr. Deng, make the arrangements.

23
00:03:05,225 --> 00:03:06,345
Yes.

24
00:03:10,625 --> 00:03:11,465
XIE'S MANSION

25
00:03:11,545 --> 00:03:14,145
Her Highness had the Imperial Guard Office
cooperate with Mr. Deng

26
00:03:14,225 --> 00:03:15,345
instead of being arbitrary.

27
00:03:15,425 --> 00:03:18,345
And Mr. Deng responded to Her Highness.

28
00:03:18,425 --> 00:03:22,865
Doesn't that mean
he accepts her political interference?

29
00:03:25,425 --> 00:03:26,785
How do I know what she thinks?

30
00:03:29,465 --> 00:03:32,985
Don't you always say
Chu Zhao is just like you?

31
00:03:33,545 --> 00:03:36,105
How do you not know what she thinks?

32
00:03:38,745 --> 00:03:39,785
Fine.

33
00:03:40,905 --> 00:03:43,465
Then I will think about it.

34
00:03:49,665 --> 00:03:52,105
Last night, she visited Mr. Deng.

35
00:03:52,945 --> 00:03:57,065
I thought they would fall out
and break up.

36
00:03:59,905 --> 00:04:03,465
Unexpectedly, they put on an act together.

37
00:04:04,425 --> 00:04:07,105
An act? For whom?

38
00:04:07,185 --> 00:04:09,105
Me, of course.

39
00:04:09,945 --> 00:04:11,985
In case my clan has sole dominance

40
00:04:12,065 --> 00:04:14,065
and seizes power from His Majesty,

41
00:04:14,585 --> 00:04:16,345
she even supports Mr. Deng

42
00:04:16,425 --> 00:04:18,785
to maintain tripartite balance
within the court.

43
00:04:19,665 --> 00:04:20,944
She's clever.

44
00:04:22,425 --> 00:04:23,705
But sadly, she's too soft-hearted.

45
00:04:24,625 --> 00:04:26,185
She wants a stable court.

46
00:04:26,785 --> 00:04:28,425
Then I will let her know

47
00:04:29,265 --> 00:04:32,025
kindness can't survive in this world.

48
00:05:02,025 --> 00:05:04,225
Have Yu Shang send this
to the Northern Desert.

49
00:05:04,305 --> 00:05:08,585
It's been years since Zhong Changrong
guarded Xinggu Pass.

50
00:05:08,665 --> 00:05:09,505
KILL ZHONG CHANGRONG AT XINGGU PASS

51
00:05:09,585 --> 00:05:11,345
He should rest.

52
00:05:11,425 --> 00:05:13,425
If Xinggu Pass is invaded…

53
00:05:13,505 --> 00:05:17,065
So… we'll have Liang Qiang prepare early.

54
00:05:31,345 --> 00:05:33,385
Greetings, Your Majesty.

55
00:05:34,265 --> 00:05:35,665
You're back, Qi Bo.

56
00:05:35,745 --> 00:05:36,825
You're just in time.

57
00:05:36,905 --> 00:05:40,065
The provisions you brought back
last time are running out.

58
00:05:40,145 --> 00:05:41,025
Go get some more.

59
00:05:41,785 --> 00:05:43,025
Already?

60
00:05:43,105 --> 00:05:45,465
We have three contingents.

61
00:05:45,545 --> 00:05:47,145
They're certainly consumed quickly.

62
00:05:47,905 --> 00:05:48,905
Three?

63
00:05:49,425 --> 00:05:51,625
The Eldest Prince is in the rear,

64
00:05:52,305 --> 00:05:54,585
but he still needs our provisions.

65
00:05:54,665 --> 00:05:57,065
My son is securing the rear.

66
00:05:57,625 --> 00:05:59,505
He must be well-fed.

67
00:06:03,585 --> 00:06:04,985
Don't worry.

68
00:06:05,505 --> 00:06:08,265
I'll get the provisions as soon as I can.

69
00:06:10,265 --> 00:06:15,105
This time, I've brought you a transaction

70
00:06:15,825 --> 00:06:17,945
that is very beneficial.

71
00:06:27,905 --> 00:06:30,025
KILL ZHONG CHANGRONG AT XINGGU PASS

72
00:06:31,305 --> 00:06:34,185
Interesting. How interesting.

73
00:06:35,625 --> 00:06:42,505
Xie Yanfang wants me to kill
Zhong Changrong at Xinggu Pass.

74
00:06:44,225 --> 00:06:49,545
Xiao Xun wants my army to pass Xiaonan.

75
00:06:51,585 --> 00:06:55,825
These two idiots both want to court me.

76
00:06:56,425 --> 00:06:57,385
All right.

77
00:06:57,465 --> 00:07:00,945
Then I will fulfill their wishes.

78
00:07:01,625 --> 00:07:02,905
Your Majesty is wise.

79
00:07:02,985 --> 00:07:05,465
Chu Ling is dead.
The State of Chu has civil strife.

80
00:07:06,065 --> 00:07:08,465
This is exactly our moment.

81
00:07:10,465 --> 00:07:12,985
Issue my order. Send a troop of soldiers.

82
00:07:14,025 --> 00:07:16,105
I'll show them

83
00:07:17,545 --> 00:07:19,505
how I can benefit

84
00:07:23,905 --> 00:07:25,265
from their own infighting.

85
00:07:25,345 --> 00:07:29,705
XINGGU PASS

86
00:07:44,545 --> 00:07:46,625
Don't move, General Liang.

87
00:07:49,105 --> 00:07:51,545
-What do you want?
-Don't be nervous.

88
00:07:52,385 --> 00:07:54,585
The Northern Desert troops
are just passing by.

89
00:07:57,625 --> 00:07:58,625
This is treason!

90
00:07:59,585 --> 00:08:01,705
It isn't.

91
00:08:01,785 --> 00:08:04,185
It's just a deal.

92
00:08:05,145 --> 00:08:06,865
Mr. Xie passed an order.

93
00:08:06,945 --> 00:08:08,465
"Their troops need a victory.

94
00:08:09,745 --> 00:08:13,625
And the victory we give them
will have no impact on our war situation."

95
00:08:14,545 --> 00:08:18,425
Does Mr. Xie know what will happen?

96
00:08:18,505 --> 00:08:22,665
He said the Northern Desert King
would send troops.

97
00:08:23,345 --> 00:08:26,265
Zhong Changrong would die at Xinggu Pass.

98
00:08:26,345 --> 00:08:27,465
Then…

99
00:08:27,545 --> 00:08:30,425
His position will be yours.

100
00:08:31,505 --> 00:08:34,625
General Liang, all you need to do
is stand here

101
00:08:34,705 --> 00:08:37,345
and pretend you didn't see anything.

102
00:09:01,905 --> 00:09:03,345
XINGGU PASS

103
00:09:03,425 --> 00:09:05,225
CHANGPING PASS

104
00:09:05,305 --> 00:09:11,225
CHANGPING PASS

105
00:09:16,105 --> 00:09:19,825
General, the enemy king
decamped and disappeared.

106
00:09:20,545 --> 00:09:26,065
So far, no beacon smoke has been seen
throughout Yunzhong.

107
00:09:27,465 --> 00:09:28,905
Could they be lying in ambush?

108
00:09:31,985 --> 00:09:35,585
From their former encampment to Yunzhong,

109
00:09:36,305 --> 00:09:40,625
there aren't valleys or depressions
for such a large army to hide.

110
00:09:40,705 --> 00:09:42,265
Report!

111
00:09:43,305 --> 00:09:44,225
Raid on Xinggu Pass!

112
00:09:48,385 --> 00:09:49,945
Zhong is just patrolling there.

113
00:09:50,025 --> 00:09:53,785
But… General Zhong's route
is a military secret.

114
00:09:54,545 --> 00:09:56,545
-Call up 500 soldiers. We'll go.
-Yes.

115
00:10:01,305 --> 00:10:03,185
General, this raid is so precise.

116
00:10:03,265 --> 00:10:04,745
Someone must have leaked our route.

117
00:10:04,825 --> 00:10:06,425
Do they think they can invade us this way?

118
00:10:06,505 --> 00:10:08,065
What a pipe dream!

119
00:10:08,905 --> 00:10:11,305
I'm their target.

120
00:10:33,865 --> 00:10:35,185
General Liang,

121
00:10:35,265 --> 00:10:37,665
the Northern Desert troops passed
through your guarding area.

122
00:10:38,265 --> 00:10:40,425
However perfectly we carry out this plan,

123
00:10:40,505 --> 00:10:42,865
Zhong Changrong will suspect you.

124
00:10:43,985 --> 00:10:45,625
When he gets to the bottom,

125
00:10:45,705 --> 00:10:48,745
by then, even if someone protects you,

126
00:10:48,825 --> 00:10:51,905
you'll have to work in the labor camp
as a guilty person.

127
00:10:51,985 --> 00:10:55,745
Your clan won't be able to rise again.

128
00:11:10,425 --> 00:11:11,465
So,

129
00:11:12,545 --> 00:11:14,225
what do you want me to do?

130
00:11:14,825 --> 00:11:16,745
You have to kill all those enemies.

131
00:11:16,825 --> 00:11:20,505
Because Zhong Changrong's followers
must witness that scene

132
00:11:20,585 --> 00:11:22,225
of valor and tragedy.

133
00:11:22,305 --> 00:11:25,465
Right now, a squad of several hundred men
is patrolling not far away.

134
00:11:27,785 --> 00:11:29,345
Shoot this whistling arrow.

135
00:11:29,425 --> 00:11:31,985
Our men will lure that squad over to you.

136
00:11:32,065 --> 00:11:34,745
That way, your bravery will be witnessed,

137
00:11:35,345 --> 00:11:37,665
and you won't die while outnumbered.

138
00:11:38,985 --> 00:11:43,505
General Liang, after you take over
the frontier command,

139
00:11:43,585 --> 00:11:46,465
you'll bring glory to the state
and fortune to people.

140
00:11:46,545 --> 00:11:49,825
Your name will go down in history.

141
00:11:55,225 --> 00:11:57,945
Charge!

142
00:12:01,745 --> 00:12:03,865
You should be guarding Xinggu Pass.
Why are you here?

143
00:12:04,465 --> 00:12:07,425
I was surveying nearby terrain
and passed by.

144
00:12:07,985 --> 00:12:10,505
Another squad is coming over.
Hold on, General Zhong.

145
00:13:15,865 --> 00:13:17,505
Take him back! Keep him alive!

146
00:13:17,585 --> 00:13:18,865
-Yes.
-Mr. Zhong.

147
00:13:21,505 --> 00:13:25,145
Hurry. Take men to defend Xinggu Pass.

148
00:13:25,785 --> 00:13:27,865
Mr. Zhong. Mr. Zhong.

149
00:13:27,945 --> 00:13:31,065
-Light a smoke signal. Full-scale alert!
-Yes.

150
00:13:31,145 --> 00:13:33,465
‎XINGGU PASS

151
00:13:42,305 --> 00:13:43,265
How's General?

152
00:13:44,385 --> 00:13:45,665
His vital organs aren't injured,

153
00:13:46,265 --> 00:13:47,465
but he's bleeding seriously.

154
00:13:48,065 --> 00:13:48,985
I'm afraid…

155
00:13:50,865 --> 00:13:52,665
Keep him alive, or I'll kill you.

156
00:13:52,745 --> 00:13:56,145
-Yes. I'll do my best.
-General.

157
00:13:56,225 --> 00:13:58,465
General. Wangcheng is lost.

158
00:14:02,785 --> 00:14:03,905
It's a trap.

159
00:14:32,865 --> 00:14:34,065
Did you have a nightmare?

160
00:14:35,545 --> 00:14:37,625
Shall I take you back for some rest?

161
00:14:43,345 --> 00:14:45,145
Your Highness, urgent frontier report.

162
00:14:45,225 --> 00:14:47,305
Wangcheng is lost.
General Zhong is badly injured.

163
00:14:50,385 --> 00:14:52,025
URGENT DISPATCH FROM YUNZHONG

164
00:14:59,545 --> 00:15:02,065
-How is Jiu doing?
-We don't know the specifics.

165
00:15:05,745 --> 00:15:07,225
Don't worry too much.

166
00:15:07,305 --> 00:15:09,865
When Jiu is there,
the frontier won't fall.

167
00:15:15,105 --> 00:15:16,825
WANGCHENG LOST. GENERAL ZHONG WOUNDED.
URGENT REQUEST FOR TROOPS AND PROVISIONS.

168
00:15:17,905 --> 00:15:21,185
The report only says enemy troops
broke through Xinggu Pass.

169
00:15:21,265 --> 00:15:22,825
Not a word is about Liang Qiang.

170
00:15:23,465 --> 00:15:25,665
He's the general guarding Xinggu Pass.

171
00:15:25,745 --> 00:15:26,785
In such a big case,

172
00:15:27,465 --> 00:15:29,185
his condition should be reported,

173
00:15:29,265 --> 00:15:30,945
whether he's dead or missing.

174
00:15:32,465 --> 00:15:35,985
Unless he's highly suspicious

175
00:15:36,905 --> 00:15:38,185
and many people are involved.

176
00:15:39,065 --> 00:15:41,785
So, at this crucial point,
it must be set aside

177
00:15:41,865 --> 00:15:43,345
to avoid shaking the morale.

178
00:15:48,345 --> 00:15:50,025
Wangcheng is strategically vital!

179
00:15:50,785 --> 00:15:54,185
Once it's lost, Yunzhong will be in peril!

180
00:15:54,265 --> 00:15:57,425
If Yunzhong is lost,

181
00:15:57,505 --> 00:15:59,505
our state will be in peril!

182
00:15:59,585 --> 00:16:00,705
That's right.

183
00:16:00,785 --> 00:16:03,065
If Yunzhong is lost, we will be in danger.

184
00:16:05,745 --> 00:16:07,785
Xie Yanlai bragged that he would

185
00:16:07,865 --> 00:16:09,865
kill the Northern Desert King,

186
00:16:09,945 --> 00:16:12,265
but now, he can't even
defend the frontier.

187
00:16:12,345 --> 00:16:13,385
He must be severely punished.

188
00:16:14,025 --> 00:16:14,945
Yes.

189
00:16:15,025 --> 00:16:18,545
He lost one city,
then he may lose another.

190
00:16:18,625 --> 00:16:22,945
How many cities are there at the frontier?

191
00:16:23,025 --> 00:16:27,465
How could Your Highness trust
such an impetuous man?

192
00:16:28,185 --> 00:16:30,345
Yeah. Things can't go on like this.

193
00:16:31,665 --> 00:16:32,625
Ministers,

194
00:16:33,665 --> 00:16:36,305
at this point, what's the use of arguing?

195
00:16:39,185 --> 00:16:41,905
The Northern Desert King sent a message,

196
00:16:42,505 --> 00:16:44,145
asking for peace talks.

197
00:16:44,225 --> 00:16:47,265
I think we should avoid
direct confrontation.

198
00:16:49,025 --> 00:16:50,385
We will

199
00:16:52,185 --> 00:16:53,625
never accept peace talks.

200
00:17:05,825 --> 00:17:06,944
Never?

201
00:17:08,865 --> 00:17:10,464
So will the war continue?

202
00:17:11,545 --> 00:17:13,585
Will we ignore the people in Wangcheng?

203
00:17:13,665 --> 00:17:17,585
The King wants friendly relations
and territorial concessions.

204
00:17:18,505 --> 00:17:19,704
Is this a peace offer?

205
00:17:19,785 --> 00:17:21,385
This is a humiliation.

206
00:17:22,224 --> 00:17:24,865
Countless soldiers shouldn't die in vain.

207
00:17:24,944 --> 00:17:27,385
My father's decade-long persistence
shouldn't be wasted.

208
00:17:27,464 --> 00:17:28,985
Wangcheng is lost,

209
00:17:29,065 --> 00:17:30,985
but Your Highness is still so stubborn.

210
00:17:31,065 --> 00:17:33,105
What will people think of you?

211
00:17:34,305 --> 00:17:36,145
Why don't you leave the court

212
00:17:37,145 --> 00:17:38,785
and let me handle this?

213
00:17:39,585 --> 00:17:41,625
Mr. Deng, are you saying

214
00:17:41,705 --> 00:17:44,305
I am to blame for the error
of the frontier troops?

215
00:17:45,665 --> 00:17:47,345
Xie Yanlai serves you.

216
00:17:48,105 --> 00:17:50,825
In that case, you can't shirk the blame.

217
00:17:51,465 --> 00:17:53,585
When I was in charge,
the frontier was safe.

218
00:17:54,305 --> 00:17:56,185
After the supervisors you sent there,

219
00:17:56,785 --> 00:17:59,105
especially Liang Qiang you favor,

220
00:17:59,185 --> 00:18:02,065
failed their duties,
the enemies managed to break in.

221
00:18:05,985 --> 00:18:08,225
Your Highness learned to shift blame.

222
00:18:09,185 --> 00:18:10,225
I would rather say,

223
00:18:10,305 --> 00:18:13,145
I interfered so late

224
00:18:13,225 --> 00:18:16,025
that frontier troops were too corrupt
to be mended.

225
00:18:16,105 --> 00:18:17,945
Even when Liang Qiang was favored,

226
00:18:18,985 --> 00:18:21,185
he couldn't reverse the decline!

227
00:18:22,025 --> 00:18:23,505
Mr. Deng,

228
00:18:24,345 --> 00:18:26,585
who do you think will benefit

229
00:18:26,665 --> 00:18:29,665
from the failure of frontier troops
and the loss of a city?

230
00:18:35,225 --> 00:18:37,105
You don't think

231
00:18:37,905 --> 00:18:40,945
I used the failure of the troops
and the suffering of the people

232
00:18:41,665 --> 00:18:44,545
to force you out of the court, do you?

233
00:18:45,745 --> 00:18:48,745
Chu Zhao, you aren't worthy.

234
00:18:49,505 --> 00:18:51,825
You always claim
you prioritize self-interest.

235
00:18:51,905 --> 00:18:54,505
I thought you were
just saying that for fun.

236
00:18:54,585 --> 00:18:58,425
What a surprise.
You really dared to do that.

237
00:18:59,185 --> 00:19:00,265
Xiaoman.

238
00:19:11,145 --> 00:19:13,265
These are your letters
with frontier troops,

239
00:19:13,345 --> 00:19:14,785
including private letters.

240
00:19:19,225 --> 00:19:23,065
Chu Zhao, how dare you pry
into my privacy?

241
00:19:23,145 --> 00:19:24,825
I just did. So what?

242
00:19:24,905 --> 00:19:26,945
You supervise by late Emperor's order.

243
00:19:27,025 --> 00:19:29,025
I protect the state by his order.

244
00:19:29,625 --> 00:19:31,745
So, I must know anything that involves

245
00:19:32,345 --> 00:19:33,825
our state affairs.

246
00:19:35,105 --> 00:19:37,345
Take out Mr. Deng's letters
to and from Liang Qiang

247
00:19:38,065 --> 00:19:41,665
and his letters with other ministers
where they plotted to depose me.

248
00:19:41,745 --> 00:19:42,745
Yes.

249
00:19:42,825 --> 00:19:43,705
YOUR ORIGIN IS NO OBSTACLE. XINGGU PASS
NEEDS YOUR TALENT. JUST GO. BY DENG YI

250
00:19:50,545 --> 00:19:51,545
Liang Qiang said

251
00:19:52,345 --> 00:19:54,345
his transfer to Xinggu Pass was improper.

252
00:19:55,785 --> 00:19:56,705
You said

253
00:19:57,625 --> 00:20:00,665
he could just go ahead
and you would take responsibility

254
00:20:01,345 --> 00:20:03,145
if anything went wrong.

255
00:20:04,465 --> 00:20:06,665
Liang Qiang did write me this letter.

256
00:20:07,185 --> 00:20:10,145
Then I replied like that. What's wrong?

257
00:20:10,225 --> 00:20:12,785
A frontier general knew it was improper.

258
00:20:14,505 --> 00:20:16,905
And a civil official like you,
far back in the Capital,

259
00:20:17,545 --> 00:20:20,785
insisted on meddling in military affairs.

260
00:20:24,465 --> 00:20:25,385
So?

261
00:20:26,545 --> 00:20:29,585
So, you won't come to the court
for a while.

262
00:20:30,185 --> 00:20:31,945
Go back home and reflect on yourself.

263
00:20:41,065 --> 00:20:41,985
Good.

264
00:20:44,145 --> 00:20:45,145
Very good.

265
00:20:46,825 --> 00:20:49,945
Let me see if you can get what you desire

266
00:20:50,865 --> 00:20:53,425
when I'm away from the court.

267
00:20:54,105 --> 00:20:56,945
Xiaoman, send him back home.

268
00:20:57,025 --> 00:20:58,825
Yes, Your Highness.

269
00:21:24,945 --> 00:21:25,825
Mr. Deng,

270
00:21:27,185 --> 00:21:28,665
how have you been?

271
00:21:30,545 --> 00:21:34,305
Mr. Xie, to what do I owe this pleasure?

272
00:21:35,145 --> 00:21:37,185
I'm here to apologize.

273
00:21:39,025 --> 00:21:40,705
You took the blame

274
00:21:41,745 --> 00:21:43,505
for the loss of Wangcheng.

275
00:21:44,545 --> 00:21:47,025
I sent the message to the Northern Desert

276
00:21:47,105 --> 00:21:50,585
and I asked Liang Qiang to defect.

277
00:21:51,305 --> 00:21:53,345
As for why the enemies
passed through Xiaonan

278
00:21:53,425 --> 00:21:55,145
to attack Wangcheng…

279
00:21:56,625 --> 00:21:57,545
I need not say,

280
00:21:58,785 --> 00:22:01,065
for you know who did that.

281
00:22:01,665 --> 00:22:02,785
Xie Yanfang!

282
00:22:05,345 --> 00:22:06,745
How could you do this

283
00:22:06,825 --> 00:22:09,025
to frontier troops and civilians
at Wangcheng?

284
00:22:09,705 --> 00:22:11,905
They are people of our state.

285
00:22:12,625 --> 00:22:14,305
They'll die a worthy death

286
00:22:16,905 --> 00:22:18,465
to sacrifice for their state.

287
00:22:19,825 --> 00:22:21,665
You can go and turn me in.

288
00:22:22,265 --> 00:22:23,305
However,

289
00:22:24,025 --> 00:22:26,025
who would believe
your one-sided statement?

290
00:22:40,745 --> 00:22:41,585
Fine.

291
00:22:43,665 --> 00:22:48,745
I'll wait and see
what exactly you are up to.

292
00:22:53,305 --> 00:22:54,985
Well, it's getting late.

293
00:22:56,945 --> 00:22:58,225
I'll take my leave.

294
00:23:07,225 --> 00:23:08,825
I do hope

295
00:23:09,945 --> 00:23:13,705
I can see you again at the court.

296
00:23:49,625 --> 00:23:51,065
Thinking about what happened?

297
00:23:56,585 --> 00:23:58,425
Be seated, Mr. Xie.

298
00:24:02,025 --> 00:24:03,705
I thought hard, but I don't get it.

299
00:24:04,385 --> 00:24:06,785
If he simply wanted me
to withdraw from the court,

300
00:24:06,865 --> 00:24:10,865
why did he sacrifice the frontier
and civilians in Wangcheng?

301
00:24:10,945 --> 00:24:12,585
This isn't Deng Yi's style.

302
00:24:12,665 --> 00:24:16,865
Your Highness,
Mr. Deng's desire has never changed.

303
00:24:16,945 --> 00:24:20,425
I have proof
that Liang Qiang serves Mr. Deng.

304
00:24:21,705 --> 00:24:25,145
So you think he wants
to command frontier troops?

305
00:24:30,065 --> 00:24:33,505
So, he wanted Mr. Zhong dead in this raid,

306
00:24:34,105 --> 00:24:36,785
then Liang Qiang would turn the tide
and take command.

307
00:24:37,385 --> 00:24:38,665
To be honest,

308
00:24:39,465 --> 00:24:41,305
it has something to do with Yanlai.

309
00:24:42,545 --> 00:24:44,105
I guess Mr. Deng believed

310
00:24:44,185 --> 00:24:47,145
Yanlai dared to make that military pledge

311
00:24:47,785 --> 00:24:50,225
because my whole clan backed him up.

312
00:24:51,425 --> 00:24:53,705
He couldn't bear to see
military power slip.

313
00:24:53,785 --> 00:24:56,825
That's why he took
desperate risks at any cost.

314
00:24:58,465 --> 00:24:59,865
As for Wangcheng…

315
00:25:01,185 --> 00:25:04,185
We are not certain if he was behind that.

316
00:25:05,145 --> 00:25:06,385
Or maybe

317
00:25:07,145 --> 00:25:08,545
that was merely an accident.

318
00:25:09,505 --> 00:25:11,465
After all, the tides of war always change.

319
00:25:11,545 --> 00:25:14,265
One false move
may lead to the loss of a city.

320
00:25:18,425 --> 00:25:20,265
I don't usually get along with Mr. Deng,

321
00:25:21,065 --> 00:25:25,145
but I refuse to believe
he would collude with our enemies.

322
00:25:26,385 --> 00:25:28,105
Now, the situation is complicated.

323
00:25:28,185 --> 00:25:32,305
For the moment,
our priority is to stabilize the court.

324
00:25:36,785 --> 00:25:37,745
I know.

325
00:25:38,825 --> 00:25:41,065
He was under house arrest

326
00:25:41,145 --> 00:25:43,065
because he argued with me
on whether to have

327
00:25:43,945 --> 00:25:45,065
peace talks.

328
00:25:46,025 --> 00:25:47,505
As for how we should handle him…

329
00:25:48,105 --> 00:25:51,745
After we take back Wangcheng
and uncover the truth, we'll know.

330
00:25:52,545 --> 00:25:54,145
Don't worry too much.

331
00:25:54,745 --> 00:25:59,025
The sudden loss of Wangcheng
was truly horrifying.

332
00:25:59,105 --> 00:26:03,025
Fortunately, Yunzhong led all units
to heavily guard it

333
00:26:03,105 --> 00:26:05,745
and fought the invaders.

334
00:26:05,825 --> 00:26:08,025
Those invaders failed to advance further.

335
00:26:10,585 --> 00:26:12,665
I have faith in frontier troops.

336
00:26:13,305 --> 00:26:14,865
But how about people in Wangcheng?

337
00:26:16,385 --> 00:26:18,025
If we reject peace talks,

338
00:26:18,105 --> 00:26:20,225
the enemies will threaten us
with a massacre.

339
00:26:22,185 --> 00:26:25,505
Peace talks start with talks.

340
00:26:25,585 --> 00:26:29,145
In that case,
we'll have time to negotiate.

341
00:26:30,745 --> 00:26:31,705
Rest assured.

342
00:26:31,785 --> 00:26:38,385
Soon, I will ask relevant ministers
to draft an agenda for you to review.

343
00:26:39,705 --> 00:26:41,105
Thank you, Mr. Xie.

344
00:26:42,305 --> 00:26:43,985
Mr. Deng has been confined.

345
00:26:44,065 --> 00:26:47,305
At this moment, I should step up.

346
00:26:48,305 --> 00:26:51,145
You're truly a blessing for our state.

347
00:26:55,425 --> 00:26:57,945
Don't say that, Your Highness.

348
00:27:00,465 --> 00:27:01,705
In every way,

349
00:27:03,025 --> 00:27:04,225
we're a family.

350
00:27:10,545 --> 00:27:12,105
Tea is good.

351
00:27:12,865 --> 00:27:14,825
But too much tea will upset you.

352
00:27:14,905 --> 00:27:16,665
It's almost lunchtime.

353
00:27:17,745 --> 00:27:21,025
Go have a good lunch with Yu
and get some sleep.

354
00:27:21,105 --> 00:27:25,265
I'm afraid we're going to confront
tough challenges.

355
00:27:26,505 --> 00:27:29,745
I certainly believe
you're tough-minded enough.

356
00:27:29,825 --> 00:27:33,945
But you still need a healthy body.

357
00:27:38,865 --> 00:27:40,265
Don't panic.

358
00:27:43,425 --> 00:27:44,665
You have me.

359
00:27:57,505 --> 00:27:58,745
Le.

360
00:27:59,665 --> 00:28:00,625
Your Highness.

361
00:28:00,705 --> 00:28:03,585
Recently, has Xiao Xun behaved?

362
00:28:03,665 --> 00:28:05,065
Precisely.

363
00:28:05,145 --> 00:28:07,865
For nearly half a year,
he hasn't left his house.

364
00:28:07,945 --> 00:28:09,825
Over the last month,
he has stayed indoors,

365
00:28:09,905 --> 00:28:11,225
making his father's birthday gift.

366
00:28:11,825 --> 00:28:13,465
-Keep watching.
-Yes.

367
00:28:19,985 --> 00:28:22,025
NEED AID URGENTLY.

368
00:28:22,105 --> 00:28:23,865
WANGCHENG LOST. GENERAL ZHONG WOUNDED.
URGENT REQUEST FOR TROOPS AND PROVISIONS.

369
00:28:31,025 --> 00:28:34,425
LONGEVITY SCROLL OF A THOUSAND BLESSINGS

370
00:28:46,825 --> 00:28:48,785
Your Highness, news just came in.

371
00:28:48,865 --> 00:28:50,425
Mr. Deng was escorted out
by the Imperial Guard Office

372
00:28:50,505 --> 00:28:51,425
and then confined in his mansion.

373
00:28:51,505 --> 00:28:52,945
The reason is unknown.

374
00:28:53,025 --> 00:28:55,185
We only know he fought
Her Highness after court.

375
00:29:00,585 --> 00:29:02,905
Your Highness, this might be our chance.

376
00:29:03,545 --> 00:29:05,625
Before I finish my father's gift,

377
00:29:07,065 --> 00:29:09,585
so much has already happened
in the Capital.

378
00:29:10,465 --> 00:29:11,825
But for me,

379
00:29:12,865 --> 00:29:14,785
nothing matters more

380
00:29:14,865 --> 00:29:18,305
than this Scroll of Longevity
for my father.

381
00:29:36,865 --> 00:29:38,505
It's finally done.

382
00:29:39,345 --> 00:29:41,345
I should go visit Mr. Deng.

383
00:29:42,345 --> 00:29:44,385
XIAONAN

384
00:29:51,665 --> 00:29:53,385
How's Xun doing?

385
00:29:53,465 --> 00:29:56,345
Very well. He's been patient.

386
00:29:56,425 --> 00:29:59,745
He has sent your birthday gift
to the Imperial Manufactories.

387
00:29:59,825 --> 00:30:01,825
It will be delivered here
with official gifts.

388
00:30:01,905 --> 00:30:05,345
I had intended to keep the official gifts
outside my prefecture.

389
00:30:06,105 --> 00:30:07,985
Since Xun's gift is among them,

390
00:30:09,145 --> 00:30:10,545
get all those gifts in, then.

391
00:30:12,625 --> 00:30:14,105
Look at this.

392
00:30:16,265 --> 00:30:19,225
WANGCHENG FELL LAST MIDNIGHT. NORTHERN
DESERT TROOPS HEADING FOR YUNZHONG

393
00:30:19,905 --> 00:30:20,905
Wangcheng is lost?

394
00:30:22,305 --> 00:30:24,705
The Northern Desert King
will threaten the court with that city.

395
00:30:24,785 --> 00:30:27,145
For the sake of thousands of civilians,

396
00:30:27,225 --> 00:30:29,145
the court will have to accept peace talks.

397
00:30:30,105 --> 00:30:32,025
But under such circumstances,

398
00:30:32,105 --> 00:30:33,985
if you send troops against the court,

399
00:30:34,065 --> 00:30:35,345
things might backfire.

400
00:30:35,945 --> 00:30:37,905
Threatening with Wangcheng,

401
00:30:37,985 --> 00:30:40,065
those foes will get what they want.

402
00:30:40,745 --> 00:30:42,865
They'll also end the war decently.

403
00:30:43,585 --> 00:30:46,265
For them, that will be a victory.

404
00:30:47,385 --> 00:30:49,105
As for the young emperor,

405
00:30:49,185 --> 00:30:52,385
Chu Zhao, Deng Yi, and Xie Yanfang,

406
00:30:53,705 --> 00:30:56,585
they will lose people's support
as well as their prestige.

407
00:30:56,665 --> 00:30:57,505
By then…

408
00:30:57,585 --> 00:30:59,585
Your prestige will rise greatly.

409
00:30:59,665 --> 00:31:02,985
When you call to arms,
the world will be yours.

410
00:31:05,825 --> 00:31:08,705
‎WANGCHENG NORTH GATE

411
00:31:16,225 --> 00:31:17,665
WANGCHENG

412
00:31:23,705 --> 00:31:24,625
Help them!

413
00:31:25,225 --> 00:31:26,145
Go. Let's help them!

414
00:31:28,145 --> 00:31:29,625
WANGCHENG

415
00:31:33,505 --> 00:31:34,745
Stop.

416
00:31:34,825 --> 00:31:37,145
See how many people here
will have to die for you!

417
00:31:37,745 --> 00:31:39,465
General, what do we do?

418
00:31:39,545 --> 00:31:41,145
Bring it on!

419
00:31:43,665 --> 00:31:45,585
-Retreat.
-General!

420
00:31:45,665 --> 00:31:46,785
I said, retreat!

421
00:31:47,985 --> 00:31:49,185
Losers!

422
00:31:49,905 --> 00:31:51,065
Bring it on!

423
00:31:57,825 --> 00:31:59,945
General, General Zhong is awake.

424
00:32:00,025 --> 00:32:02,465
According to the Army Physician,
he will survive.

425
00:32:02,545 --> 00:32:03,385
Won't you see him?

426
00:32:07,825 --> 00:32:08,825
Glad he won't die.

427
00:32:10,025 --> 00:32:11,745
What about the mission I gave you?

428
00:32:11,825 --> 00:32:14,785
Thirty-six soldiers skilled
in disguise and assassination

429
00:32:14,865 --> 00:32:17,665
and familiar with the enemy's capital
are in position.

430
00:32:18,345 --> 00:32:19,425
As you commend,

431
00:32:19,505 --> 00:32:21,225
all has been kept confidential.

432
00:32:22,105 --> 00:32:23,265
Very good.

433
00:32:28,225 --> 00:32:29,385
Move out.

434
00:32:42,585 --> 00:32:44,025
Wangcheng is strategically vital.

435
00:32:44,105 --> 00:32:45,385
WANGCHENG

436
00:32:45,465 --> 00:32:47,665
Thousands of civilians
are in the hands of enemies.

437
00:32:48,465 --> 00:32:49,905
But Yanlai stays within the camp.

438
00:32:51,225 --> 00:32:52,585
No wonder ministers complain.

439
00:32:55,345 --> 00:32:57,945
A general in war
isn't bound by imperial orders.

440
00:32:59,225 --> 00:33:02,105
-I trust him.
-I trust him too.

441
00:33:04,545 --> 00:33:06,985
So, when the ministers
wanted to replace him,

442
00:33:07,065 --> 00:33:08,305
I didn't approve.

443
00:33:08,905 --> 00:33:12,785
But to be honest, I'm a little worried.

444
00:33:12,865 --> 00:33:14,505
Will he be reckless at this juncture?

445
00:33:22,265 --> 00:33:23,545
Did he really go

446
00:33:25,025 --> 00:33:26,585
to kill the Northern Desert King?

447
00:33:30,905 --> 00:33:32,305
Under such circumstances,

448
00:33:32,385 --> 00:33:34,305
even if Yanlai manages to kill the King,

449
00:33:35,185 --> 00:33:37,225
the Eldest Prince will ascend the throne.

450
00:33:39,825 --> 00:33:41,745
He's fierce and warlike,

451
00:33:41,825 --> 00:33:43,545
but not as far-sighted as his father.

452
00:33:44,265 --> 00:33:47,705
By then, he will invade
in the name of revenge.

453
00:33:47,785 --> 00:33:50,145
His army's morale will soar.

454
00:33:51,025 --> 00:33:52,705
I'm afraid peace talks will be hard.

455
00:33:53,585 --> 00:33:57,745
Is there really no solution
to Wangcheng's problem?

456
00:34:00,265 --> 00:34:02,025
WANGCHENG

457
00:34:03,905 --> 00:34:05,665
In that case,

458
00:34:07,625 --> 00:34:10,025
-I'll have to go to Yunzhong again.
-No.

459
00:34:22,545 --> 00:34:25,025
When I go, I can at least
steady the troops.

460
00:34:26,304 --> 00:34:27,705
I'll go instead.

461
00:34:31,385 --> 00:34:33,105
There's something ministers can do,

462
00:34:33,985 --> 00:34:35,225
but a princess can't.

463
00:34:36,705 --> 00:34:38,545
-You…
-Rest assured.

464
00:34:38,625 --> 00:34:41,465
I will not accept any of their conditions.

465
00:34:42,385 --> 00:34:44,025
Yu is my hope.

466
00:34:44,744 --> 00:34:47,344
I place great hopes on him
and intend to support him.

467
00:34:48,545 --> 00:34:52,385
When he was little, he witnessed
his parents' brutal death.

468
00:34:53,665 --> 00:34:56,824
He barely survived and took the throne.

469
00:34:56,905 --> 00:34:58,345
Then rebellion and invasion came.

470
00:34:58,945 --> 00:35:01,145
If he couldn't be a wise emperor

471
00:35:01,905 --> 00:35:02,905
who expanded his state

472
00:35:03,505 --> 00:35:05,545
and achieved something
beyond his forebears,

473
00:35:07,745 --> 00:35:09,665
it would be unfair to what he suffered.

474
00:35:13,745 --> 00:35:15,785
And accepting peace talks

475
00:35:17,185 --> 00:35:20,385
is a humiliation to someone like me.

476
00:35:20,465 --> 00:35:22,505
Then, what are you going to do?

477
00:35:23,265 --> 00:35:26,825
Will you trade the people
in Wangcheng for victory?

478
00:35:30,145 --> 00:35:31,705
How could you think of me that way?

479
00:35:38,945 --> 00:35:40,505
You broke my heart.

480
00:35:42,265 --> 00:35:45,225
Rejecting peace talks is your idea.

481
00:35:46,065 --> 00:35:48,065
Your reputation is Yu's reputation.

482
00:35:48,905 --> 00:35:51,025
How could I ever abandon people
in Wangcheng?

483
00:35:51,985 --> 00:35:53,945
It's all right that you don't trust me.

484
00:35:55,305 --> 00:35:58,225
You should have faith in what I can do.

485
00:36:03,305 --> 00:36:04,345
That's right.

486
00:36:06,305 --> 00:36:08,025
I have faith in what you can do.

487
00:36:30,585 --> 00:36:31,705
From tomorrow on,

488
00:36:33,105 --> 00:36:35,865
kill a hundred civilians
on the rampart every day

489
00:36:36,785 --> 00:36:39,465
until the State of Chu accepts
all our conditions.

490
00:36:40,105 --> 00:36:41,185
Yes.

491
00:36:42,265 --> 00:36:44,865
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

492
00:36:44,945 --> 00:36:46,385
JUSTICE HANGS ON HIGH

493
00:36:49,385 --> 00:36:52,065
Aren't you a follower
of the Eldest Prince?

494
00:36:52,145 --> 00:36:54,825
Why are you here
instead of in our capital?

495
00:36:54,905 --> 00:36:58,145
The Eldest Prince… He was killed.

496
00:36:58,865 --> 00:37:00,105
What did you say?

497
00:37:09,825 --> 00:37:12,225
It's something my son always keeps.

498
00:37:12,305 --> 00:37:15,705
Some enemy soldiers invaded
our capital and killed His Highness.

499
00:37:16,345 --> 00:37:19,265
Before His Highness died,
he gave this to me.

500
00:37:19,345 --> 00:37:22,185
I fought my way out
to bring you this news!

501
00:37:22,785 --> 00:37:24,025
You must avenge His Highness!

502
00:37:25,865 --> 00:37:27,305
How dare you curse my son!

503
00:37:29,025 --> 00:37:29,905
Son.

504
00:37:30,505 --> 00:37:32,465
My son. My son!

505
00:37:33,545 --> 00:37:35,865
WANGCHENG

506
00:37:35,945 --> 00:37:36,945
Your Majesty.

507
00:37:38,065 --> 00:37:39,545
Oh my son.

508
00:37:44,305 --> 00:37:47,145
CAPITAL

509
00:37:53,145 --> 00:37:55,945
When Mr. Xie goes, he will succeed.

510
00:37:56,025 --> 00:37:58,425
We must teach those foes a good lesson!

511
00:37:58,505 --> 00:37:59,865
-Yes.
-That's right.

512
00:37:59,945 --> 00:38:00,865
Well said!

513
00:38:00,945 --> 00:38:01,785
Give them a lesson.

514
00:38:01,865 --> 00:38:03,545
-Yes.
-Show them what we can do.

515
00:38:03,625 --> 00:38:06,905
Mr. Xie, we'll entrust you
with frontier affairs.

516
00:38:08,225 --> 00:38:10,225
His Majesty and I believe

517
00:38:10,305 --> 00:38:16,105
you will protect our people
and safeguard our state's dignity.

518
00:38:16,185 --> 00:38:18,545
I will not fail my mission.

519
00:38:25,465 --> 00:38:26,825
Great news!

520
00:38:28,625 --> 00:38:29,945
Great news!

521
00:38:30,545 --> 00:38:32,545
Oh no. Great victory!

522
00:38:32,625 --> 00:38:33,905
Great victory!

523
00:38:39,105 --> 00:38:40,585
Guard General Xie Yanlai

524
00:38:41,265 --> 00:38:43,025
has killed the Eldest Prince
of Northern Desert,

525
00:38:43,105 --> 00:38:44,625
broken into the King's camp,

526
00:38:44,705 --> 00:38:47,545
and caught… caught the King alive!

527
00:39:08,705 --> 00:39:11,065
My son!

528
00:39:16,865 --> 00:39:18,185
Terrific!

529
00:39:19,105 --> 00:39:20,265
He caught the King alive.

530
00:39:20,345 --> 00:39:22,785
‎Great.

531
00:39:22,865 --> 00:39:24,225
‎Yes, indeed.

532
00:39:32,185 --> 00:39:33,465
Great.

533
00:39:35,745 --> 00:39:38,665
Yes. This is great.

